- preserve high-quality Ukrainian Cyrillic rendering and current typography as closely as practical; prefer a repository-built/self-hosted deterministic font solution over merely hiding errors;
- do not suppress console errors, alter the existing Playwright assertion, or change #6781 DailyWords 404/5xx/network behavior;
- do not commit generated lexicon drift or unrelated build artifacts;
- add focused regression coverage proving built page/CSS has no Google Fonts runtime dependency, if the existing test architecture supports it;
- run the exact failing Playwright test site/e2e/atlas-practice.spec.ts at the WotD case or the whole file, relevant Vitest/tests, and a production build;
- inspect final diff/status, commit with X-Agent: cursor/fix-6783-wotd-404-cursor, push, open a DRAFT PR against main, link #6783/#6375 as appropriate, never merge;
